(2) In the appeal of any case defended in the Municipal Court of the City of Jasper, Georgia, to the Superior Court or the appellate courts of the State of Georgia;
(3) In any case in which the indigent defendant was convicted in the Municipal Court of the City of Jasper, Georgia, and is challenging such conviction through habeas corpus;
(4) To administer the oaths required by law to the bailiffs or other officers of the court and otherwise to aid the presiding judge in organizing the court as may be necessary; and
